UU Remote for Linux @VERSION@ - Ubuntu 24.04 GNOME Wayland offline bundle

Supported host: Ubuntu 24.04 Noble amd64, GNOME Shell 46, Wayland session.

Install every package in one APT transaction from this extracted directory:

  sudo apt install ./*.deb

Do not install this bundle on X11 or a different Ubuntu/GNOME release. APT must
finish configuring every package successfully. Save your work, then log out
and log back in to GNOME Wayland so the new Mutter library is loaded.

No repository key or GitHub Pages source is required. SHA256SUMS covers all six
Debian packages in this directory.
